## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates the ability to reason about real-world paging under SLA constraints in multi-tenant containerized environments.

## Key Concepts

- Deadline-aware paging and QoS management
- Per-page lifecycle with CAS-based fault claiming
- Multi-tenant memory quotas and NUMA placement
- Tail-latency testing and eviction strategies

## Code Example

